<section>
  <section id="liens">
    <h1>Links</h1>
  </section>
  <section>
    <ul>
      <li>Visible to everyone</li>
      <li>Link text must be meaningful</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Visible</h2>
    <img
      alt="Screenshot links not underlined in menu, underlined in paragraphs"
      src="https://images.anysurfer.be/linkteksten-20100609-171818.png"
    />
    <p>Don't use color only!</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Use meaningful link texts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Visitors scan links before reading page</li>
      <li>Screenreader users navigate through link lists</li>
      <li>
        SEO: search engines rank websites higher when using relevant keywords in
        link text
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Meaningful?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Describe the link's target</li>
      <li>Keep it brief</li>
      <li>
        Describe what will happen when the link is activated: e.g. download pdf,
        play video, play sound,...
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Example (good)</h2>
    <p>The link text gives an idea of where the link is going:</p>
    <UiCode language="html">
      <a href="/opening_hours.html">Opening hours</a>
    </UiCode>
    <img
      class="stretch"
      src="https://images.anysurfer.be/links/temesis_liens_significatifs_ok.png"
      alt="text with links 'WCAG 2.0', 'Braillenet', etc: OK "
    />
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>A link is a promise</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Download <a href="#">this season's programme</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#">Listen to our interview with Boris Johnson</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#">Download the BBC News app from the Apple Store</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p>Not good</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="http://www.seniorennet.be/Pages/Thuis_op_internet/computerhulp.php#3">
          'Click here '
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>'Download' with no extra info</li>
      <li>'Brochure' without the title of the document</li>
      <li>'Read more'</li>
      <li>&lt;&lt; &lt; 1 2 3 4 &gt; &gt;&gt;</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Make 'read more' links more meaningful</h2>
    <p>If you cannot make the visible text more meaningful</p>
    <UiCode language="html" is:raw>
      <h2>Storm Dudley hits Europe</h2>
      <p>Lots of wind and some damage.</p>
      <a href="article.html">
	      Read more
        <span class="sr_only">about Storm Dudley hits Europe</span>
      </a>
    </UiCode>
  </section>
</section>
